{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "f3fa936e78d4fb246b52c1768f2a8952365657f47cfe1f6fd7747b01cb9a4df2", "ja": "姉妹", "zh": "姊妹", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "818bce18119fb142e3592617bd2c2a478061bbd3ee57df26a86fccb23418beb8", "ja": "ヒーロー達の活躍により、戦局はヒーローズ\n有利に進む。しかし紬は出撃前に姉の話を\n聞いた事で迷いが生じ、戦闘中も上の空に。\nそんな紬を叱咤するジュリア、励ます茜。\nそこに、本部襲撃の報せが入る。", "zh": "在众英雄的活跃之下，战局逐渐倾向于\n英雄联盟，但䌷因为在出击前听闻了\n姊姊的事，迷惘的她在战斗中仍心不在焉。\n对此茱莉亚出声斥责，而茜则给予鼓励。\n就在这时，传来了总部遭到攻击的消息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1001_desutorukanntai", "source_sha256": "137b4f236036e9375833a415248231a4612e4f6318e89ba4a90d44a795d0a6d2", "ja": "『前方に敵影確認。\n全艦砲撃準備！　繰り返す、全艦砲撃準備！』", "zh": "『前方发现敌影。\n全舰做好炮击准备！重复，全舰做好炮击准备！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "b4da949860ffb0ebd1c2ed9ffcfdd72a1d22b009c937aac3322b5f77896e3c1b", "ja": "ハーイ、ヒーロー！　たったひとりで、\nこの数の艦隊を相手するつもりなノ？　バカだネ！", "zh": "嗨～英雄！你打算自己一个人\n对抗这么多艘战舰呀？真是蠢到家了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "10310b6b5ae0d7c8e19b33341950415c863a1275832591fae2051bbc9b79eb73", "ja": "えー？　わたし、バカじゃないよ～？\nそれに、ひとりじゃないもん。", "zh": "咦～？我才不蠢呢～\n而且，我也不是一个人喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1004_honnbukaranotuusinn", "source_sha256": "63531a9da9db6040835369e48ccce2bdff745f66eb90fb557b9a7fa4eeef61b1", "ja": "『ジャイアントレディとジャイアントガールより入電！\n沿岸部の潜水艦隊を撃破！　ソナーがくすぐったい！』", "zh": "『巨人淑女和巨人女孩来讯！\n已击破沿岸的潜水舰队！声纳好痒！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3beeb7fd02068febb898de4499f95fb4fcc713f17bbcc02e40a38d75a4308f67", "ja": "ほら、わたしの背中には、みんながいるんだから。\nここは絶対に通しませんよー！", "zh": "听到没有，我背后可是有伙伴在为我撑腰。\n你休想通过这里──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "467c90b2da1a4091fbbcbb1f1f04c7b45b9b9c1898cf084c9a6bf88a5bbb956d", "ja": "その余裕、いつまで続くかナ～？\nさあヒーロー、最高のダンスを見せてネ！", "zh": "我倒要看看你的从容能维持多久～\n来吧，英雄，让我见识见识最棒的舞蹈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1007_se", "source_sha256": "55ef9b4a0db51d2fd994b0b8a078bc6f1fb6cb1280e19f71df375f4b6ae9b5d4", "ja": "ズドドーン！　ズドドドーン！", "zh": "咻──砰砰！咻──砰砰砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1009_se", "source_sha256": "1c52be3f3f4987964723905af47752ff66fe1e48541d80332473206ede9e9e19", "ja": "ズガガーーーーン！！！！", "zh": "咻砰砰────！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7691a1d24a92bb6a741fee85c1b2cfa1f92c288165f984c909a89726d52a9cba", "ja": "歌織姉さん……。\nどうして、デストルドーなんかに……。", "zh": "歌织姊姊……\n你为什么会加入死欲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "725333c74d0a79f84ccd16749711a4ceaa6ba25fdd72fa7fd29c2c9c308ece54", "ja": "（姉さんは優しくて……、あきらめない人だった。\n人々を守るために、いつも傷だらけになりながら……）", "zh": "（姊姊是如此善良……意志又坚定，\n她为了守护世人，总是让自己满身伤痕……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3100c54f3508b683e4ffbbeb512d506dcbf8ad3f86f75b862bee2945574ef054", "ja": "それなのに、どうしてなの？\n姉さん……！", "zh": "可是，为什么会变成这样？\n姊姊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "b459d5fc00a83ca034a9255b0dd4d45626408a085f51eadf86edddb37cb84dbd", "ja": "ムギ、なにボーッとしてるんだ！\n今は戦闘中だぞ！？", "zh": "䌷，你在发什么呆啊！\n战斗还没结束耶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "3fec25abb9dd344781900ae1cac68186267335b298a6539a6ab1410410b3bfdf", "ja": "つむりん、大丈夫？\nほらほら、茜ちゃん人形あげるから、元気出してね！", "zh": "䌷䌷，你还好吗？\n来，给你小茜娃娃，打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0d2a0511697c4fdc5e794840f5af4591f045a70da1af5549f7e832ade4384f55", "ja": "あ……ご、ごめんなさい、二人とも！\nちょっと考え事を……。", "zh": "啊……两、两位，对不起！\n我在想事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "3c53f668660edd6fcf5e93ec9e889d3f8e8140fd2002d6318f618a035c68c032", "ja": "うんうん、気にしなくていいよ！\n茜ちゃんたちは、ズッ友だからネ！", "zh": "没关系的，你别放在心上！\n小茜我们永远都是你的好朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "5e20b74bc9fdd434d891cda98cf45efe5ce8ebc44bc96f6f7d7622d444d8b4f7", "ja": "あのな、バカネ。何度も言うけど、\nウチらは友達じゃない。仲間だ、仲間！", "zh": "喂，笨蛋茜，我已经说过很多次了，\n我们不是朋友，是伙伴，伙伴啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "05c008640ac0466139d54587ddbe302796287554b8796e308092a3328b9da76e", "ja": "似たようなものでしょ？　それに、つむりんは\n戦闘苦手だし。キネティックパワーはすごいけどね！", "zh": "意思差不多吧？而且䌷䌷本来就不习惯战斗，\n虽然她的动能威力很厉害就是了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "82a09f8b21cf5aa9e06e56dbc02d35d4dc975d7a0c1edb82f0d98aa4cbc5d714", "ja": "いつまでも苦手じゃマズいだろ？　ジェネシスは\nヒーローのチームだ。戦わないわけにいかない。", "zh": "一直半生不熟的怎么行啊？\nGenesis可是英雄小队，有战斗的义务。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "fa16c9434eaadc88dd19268c13977fa3c3df4188fe7e177f208eba4e07dce399", "ja": "それに無理を言ってるつもりもない。あたしは、\nムギにその能力があるからいってるんだ。", "zh": "而且我并不是在强人所难，我是相信\n䌷有这个能耐，所以才这么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1021_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "1022f9b53254e79c26469d803b4c11264cc3550e0c150ec2f705d8f5d57a30cf", "ja": "まあまあ、ジュリアンもつむりんも。つむりんの\n潜在能力は、チームジェネシス・最終奥義ってコトで！", "zh": "好啦好啦，茱莉安和䌷䌷都静下心来，反正䌷䌷的潜能\n就是Genesis小队的最终奥义！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "a00b56dc33768402d63a30c87bf7d411d03755db1f2e0850a3823cd4dc58f368", "ja": "それにこの程度の相手なら、二人だけで十分だし！\nねえねえ、茜ちゃん強すぎちゃってない？　大丈夫？", "zh": "而且这种程度的对手，派两个人就很够了！\n欸欸，小茜是不是太强了呀？这样没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "1c75916354b65bd10672ef670ffdfa4c0a95a65df1f36a82937465a1ec608336", "ja": "それも気になるんだよな……。\nいくらなんでも、手応えがなさすぎると思わないか？", "zh": "这点也让我很在意……\n再怎么说，打起来也未免太没劲了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1025_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3da9a2c338030252e309b04c9dbac7fd8a4566df7b056b765414bde04e9180cc", "ja": "つまり……艦隊や爆撃機は、\nただの足止めではないと……？", "zh": "也就是说……舰队还有轰炸机，\n不单单是要拖住我们而已……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "bfbf19a48675e47df29188bb643722d1c0647c8f457f59d6db6702f68260bc98", "ja": "ああ。……それにまだ、『黒髪』が出てきてない。\nあいつがいるなら、こんなもので終わるはずが……。", "zh": "没错……而且『黑发』也还没现身，\n她如果有在战场上，绝对不会这么简单就结束……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1027_honnbukaranotuusinn", "source_sha256": "6f011826c4e05e445bea231833c3f55941fdeb6f31d4367b505af395fea4b005", "ja": "『全ヒーローに通達！　ヒーローズ本部に敵襲あり！\nネメシスのリーダーを名乗る者が……』", "zh": "『通知所有英雄！英雄联盟总部遭受敌袭！\n自称是Nemesis首脑的人……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1028_honnbukaranotuusinn", "source_sha256": "f9ca4221d9709aeccda6c2815e909cd6de47e53e057f2c4532a3b61ecf89831e", "ja": "『うっ！？　うわあぁーーーっ！？』", "zh": "『唔！？哇啊啊───！？』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1029_se", "source_sha256": "203d2a230f3f474239d44ca3bf90b862b1c4070c17d4e12c72b001cea7b0ea63", "ja": "チュドーン！　ガガッ、ピー……。", "zh": "砰──！喀喀、哔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7c4d66e39d64e2b4a559780f2c5c3599a33c00bf625ba2a24fceba6b6a452400", "ja": "ほ、本部に敵襲！？\nヒーローズは、全軍出撃中なのに！", "zh": "总、总部被攻击了！？\n但英雄联盟全员都出动了耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0081_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_05_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "7b0b0fc27de144062a2092e0b4c0fa9e744315aa137e9e26ff927d9813ec6bd0", "ja": "くそっ、やられた！\nムギ、アカネ！　本部に戻る、急げ！", "zh": "可恶，被摆了一道！\n䌷、茜！我们立刻回去总部！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
